{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売の『月刊エンタメ』\n中田載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマについて語ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/2839565/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材とかってだいたい\nアイドルについて語る事多いから\n知らない方もいると思うけど\nかなりドラマ好きなんですよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお仕事無かったから\n1日中、録画してたドラマ見てました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季のドラマ見終わるまで\nあとちょっと！ってとこまできました` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事でドラマについて語ったの初めてです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/2839565/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非チェックしてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月最後ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べマーズの名シーンを今月中に描くと\nお約束していたので描きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/2839565/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの名シーン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間かけて描いたので\nどのシーンかすぐわかると思いますけ\nいやーやっぱり最終回ですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この二人が映るたびに\nちょっと複雑な気持ちになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/01/2839565/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別れ際の衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}